This product includes a vendored copy of conan_provider.cmake from the
CMake-Conan project (conan-io/cmake-conan), licensed under the MIT License.
It was vendored unmodified from that project, added by commit 323cd037
(2026-04-29); exactly one commit has ever touched this path, so the copy has
not been modified in this repository since it was vendored. Its git blob
object id is 0682ee520addb66c0e82ac13e853b93e2f80bb4f. That is the id of the
content stored in the repository, which uses LF line endings, not the hash of
a checked-out file; a checkout with different line endings hashes differently.
Any later modification must be recorded here.

Third-party dependencies are resolved at configure time by Conan and are not
shipped inside this repository. Each dependency's license is recorded in
packaging/dependency-watch.json and emitted into the generated SBOM.
The optional MySQL driver links against libmysqlclient, which is
GPL-2.0-only WITH Universal-FOSS-exception-1.0; that option (with_mysql) is
disabled by default and degrades to an error stub when the library is absent.
